msgstr "**使用示例**:"

#: source/how-to/curriculums.rst:55
msgid "Dynamically Modifying Environment Parameters"
msgstr "动态修改环境参数"

#: source/how-to/curriculums.rst:57
msgid ""
"The class :class:`modify_env_param` is a "
":class:`~isaaclab.managers.ManagerTermBase` subclass that lets you target "
"any dotted attribute path in the environment and apply a user-supplied "
"function to compute a new value at runtime. It handles nested attributes, "
"dictionary keys, list or tuple indexing, and respects a ``NO_CHANGE`` "
"sentinel if no update is desired."
msgstr ""
":class:`modify_env_param` 是一个 :class:`~isaaclab.managers.ManagerTermBase` "
"的子类，允许您定位环境中的任何点属性路径，并应用用户提供的函数以在运行时计算新值。它处理嵌套属性、字典键、列表或元组索引，并在不需要更新时尊重 "
"``NO_CHANGE`` 标志。"

#: source/how-to/curriculums.rst:95
msgid "Modify Term Configuration"
msgstr "修改 Term 配置"

#: source/how-to/curriculums.rst:97
msgid ""
"The subclass :class:`modify_term_cfg` provides a more concise style address "
"syntax, using consistent with hydra config syntax. It otherwise behaves "
"identically to :class:`modify_env_param`."
msgstr ""
"子类 :class:`modify_term_cfg` 提供了更简洁的地址语法样式，使用与 hydra 配置语法一致。否则，其行为与 "
":class:`modify_env_param` 完全相同。"
